Ground Chicken Pizza

Enough for one 12" crust (one 3-cup bread
machine pizza dough recipe makes two)

1 lb   ground chicken
3/4    cup frozen corn
1/2 c  sliced green onions
1/3    cup barbeque sauce
6 oz   grated mozzerela cheese
1/2 c  diced onion


Buttermilk Dressing

1/2 c buttermilk
3 T   white wine vinegar
2 T   sour cream
1 T   sugar
1 T   minced green onion  
1 T   chopped parsley








